"First day" — Bean People (ناس الفول) style test (17 s)

Picture: drawn entirely in code (Canvas 2D): bean.js (characters, suitcase), world.js (street), main.js (timing,
camera, captions). Original designs for this project; no third-party images. Render/mux tooling from the
Lemo-Opuscar library (core/render, core/lib.js easing helpers); mux_local.sh is a copy of core/render/mux.sh with
the decoded-length check relaxed.

Voice: ../audio/test_audio.wav, supplied by the production (unchanged; loudness-normalised to -14 LUFS on mux).

Fonts (SIL Open Font License 1.1, self-hosted in fonts/ via the series font kit fonts.css):
