- Lilita One — Juan Montoreano — github.com/google/fonts/tree/main/ofl/lilitaone (sign, name tabs, chip)
- Baloo Bhaijaan 2 — Ek Type — github.com/google/fonts/tree/main/ofl/baloobhaijaan2 (Arabic captions)
- Lalezar — Borna Izadpanah — loaded by fonts.css, not drawn in this clip

